# 8. Proof of Concept (PoC)

The attacker uploaded the following JavaScript to the exploit server:

```javascript
alert(document.cookie)
```

The cache was poisoned by repeatedly requesting the JavaScript resource while supplying attacker-controlled forwarding headers.

Subsequent users requesting:

```text
/resources/js/tracking.js
```

received a cached redirect pointing to the attacker's infrastructure.

The browser then loaded and executed the malicious JavaScript.

